Package: twostage
Title: Admissible Two-Stage Single-Arm Trial Designs with Binary Endpoint
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Andrea", "Arfe", email = "andrea.arfe@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Enumerates all admissible two-stage single-arm clinical trial
    designs for a binary endpoint. Supports futility and efficacy stopping
    at an interim analysis, with an irrevocability constraint ensuring that
    an interim efficacy declaration cannot be overturned by the final analysis.
